  "limits": [
    "COCO-Stuff PNG index 255 is void. PNG index 0 is person. Label ID 0 is void in labels.txt.",
    "Vegetation follows the selected scene labels. Fruit and vegetable classes describe food objects, including detached produce, and lie outside the vegetation target.",
    "COCO and COCO-Stuff annotations are CC BY 4.0. COCO images are subject to Flickr terms.",
    "This evaluation measures COCO label recovery. COCO val2017 may overlap SAM3 training data.",
    "The pinned SegFormer model metadata lists ADE20K (scene_parse_150) as its fine-tuning dataset. A ZIP byte-length and CRC32 comparison of all 20,210 ADEChallengeData2016 training JPEGs with all 5,000 COCO val2017 JPEGs found zero byte-identical matches. Re-encoded duplicates and pretraining overlap remain unknown.",
    "A negative contains no mapped vegetation and at most 2% void. Plants can still be present in the void area or outside the mapped taxonomy."
  ],
